  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IPRT will train 48 female on health care provision , 60male on apprenticeships, 44 on small business management, 20 trainees on beekeeping and 20 trainees on graphic design in order to earn income and improve their livelihood. The total beneficiaries that are benefiting from the proposed project are 192.</narrative>
